Package: cortexfs
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: LIghtJUNction <lightjunction.me@gmail.com>
Depends: bubblewrap (>= 0.10.0), ca-certificates, curl, fuse3, libsecret-1-0, systemd, util-linux
Conflicts: cortexfs-git, cortex-cli
Replaces: cortexfs-git, cortex-cli
Homepage: https://github.com/LIghtJUNction/cortexfs
Description: FUSE filesystem interface for agent runtimes
 CortexFS exposes models, agents, tools, and durable sessions through a small
 Linux filesystem interface mounted at /ctx.
